LOCATION:Steve's Fishing and Adventure Farm\, 1201 S Highway 99\, Walnut Hi
 ll\, FL 32568
DESCRIPTION:Mon-Sat through Nov 24 · mostly 2 PM to 6 PM\, 2 PM to 5 PM fr
 om Nov 16\n\nSteve's Farm has rebranded as Steve's Fishing and Adventure F
 arm and opened a fall attraction in Walnut Hill with a corn maze\, a giant
  slide\, a kids' zipline\, a jump pad\, hayrides\, a wagon train\, a sunfl
 ower field and a pumpkin patch. It suits a family with small children who 
 want a half day outdoors. The farm's ticket page lists day passes at $15.0
 0 to $19.45 and a $35 season pass\, so check it for each day's hours befor
 e driving out.\n\nPrice: from $19.45\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.
 com/events/ev-steves-farm-adventure-zone-0929.html
