 8
DESCRIPTION:Oct 30 to Nov 8 · Weekdays 4 PM · Weekends 12 PM\n\nThe Great
 er Gulf State Fair fills the Mobile fairgrounds for ten days with a midway
  of rides\, a rodeo\, a community stage and a pickin porch. It is the larg
 est fair in the Mobile area and a good outing for a family that wants a fu
 ll evening of rides and fair food. Children 4 and under do not need an adm
 ission ticket\, though they do need a wristband to ride. General admission
  and ride prices are not printed on the fair's pages\, so check the ticket
  store before driving over.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https
 ://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-greater-gulf-state-fair-1030.html
