SUMMARY:Documentary of the Month: Building the Eiffel Tower at the Nicevill
 e Library
LOCATION:Niceville Library\, 206 N Partin Dr\, Niceville\, FL 32578
DESCRIPTION:Thursday 11/12 · 5:00 PM\n\nThe Niceville Library screens a 55
  minute documentary on the engineering behind the Eiffel Tower. It was bui
 lt for the 1889 World's Fair in just over two years and became the tallest
