 efing 8:30 AM · Tournament 9:00 AM\n\nThe University of West Florida Athl
 etics program and its Alumni Association run the Argos Aim High clay shoot
  fundraiser. It's held at the Santa Rosa Shooting Center in Pace. Teams of
  four enter for $750\, with breakfast at check-in\, plus lunch and awards 
 after. Registration and breakfast start at 7:30 AM\, a mandatory safety br
 iefing follows at 8:30 AM\, and the tournament starts at 9:00 AM. Shooters
  bring their own shotgun\, ammunition\, and eye and ear protection\; shell
 s are limited to No. 7.5\, 8 or 9 shot. A rain date of December 4\, 2026 c
 overs an October washout.\n\nPrice: from $750\n\nDetails: https://coastale
 ventures.com/events/ev-argos-aim-high-clay-shoot-1009.html
