 each's original Mardi Gras krewe\, rolls marching units\, oversized floats
  and krewe royalty from Avenida 11 along Via de Luna to the Gulfside Pavil
 ion at Casino Beach. The parade starts at 2:00 PM rain or shine\, floats l
 ine up from 11:00 AM\, and an awards ceremony and party follow at the pavi
 lion. There is no charge to attend and parking is free\, but the lots begi
 n to fill around 10:00 AM.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastalevent
 ures.com/events/ev-krewe-of-wrecks-mardi-gras-parade-0207.html
